',len(c['linked_trace_ids']),'traces',c['linked_trace_ids'][:3])\"","description":"Read the open incident cards","timeout":90000}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_01PZe7n8ZagjnbpX1itncaC9":{"cwd":"/d/storybound"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"37894345-156e-41fe-9405-e1ccccfaf63f","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfwusMd1EgUyufauYYAuK","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"90d0ab40-db07-44bc-bc1d-736828cd0d85","timestamp":"2026-10-12T07:00:49.860Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"D:\\storybound","sessionId":"531bd6f2-4e0c-4a05-a2e1-9f902bd0eeb6","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"experiments/architecture-and-chaos","slug":"glimmering-splashing-ladybug"}
{"parentUuid":"90d0ab40-db07-44bc-bc1d-736828cd0d85","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"6f9d35b9-278f-4396-aeb9-e71bdbc18fe9","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PZe7n8ZagjnbpX1itncaC9","type":"tool_result","content":"03af6a94-7ea3-4b92-b47b-79551c74ba26 open critical 2026-10-12T06:42 \r\n  Resolve Infinite Repair Loop in `create-storybook` Workflow by Capping Validation Retries and Relaxing `lesson_concept_in_scene` Guardrail \r\n  The `create-storybook` workflow enters an infinite or highly repetitive loop of generation and validation (`node.verify` and `node.settle`) when a guardrail violation (such as `lesson_concept_in_scene`) is detected. Because there is no strict cap on the number of repair attempts, the workflow runs until the client connection is closed or times out, resulting in a `Cannot send a request, as the client has been closed` error on downstream LLM calls. \r\n  7 traces ['6b6e7a28e2cdba37e6e51ba67ad84ced', 'f87515cb76d7e92afd1f396e9288e912', '26c3b43eb6e315952161558aa8d426a4']\r\na062a576-f517-4564-a1ac-7f406de62c15 open high 2026-10-12T06:42 \r\n  Investigate Latency and Quota Exhaustion in `illustrate` Tool \r\n  Root cause is not established. In trace {{trace:b2620d8e6a7ad46d31d872882b780677}}, the `illustrate` tool call takes 249,436ms to complete. During its execution, a call to `gemini-3.1-flash-image` fails with a `429 RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED` error, and a subsequent call to `gemini-2.5-flash-image` takes 8,054ms. The exact cause of the remaining ~241 seconds of latency within the `illustrate` tool is not established because the internal implementation details and retry/fallback mechanisms of the tool ar \r\n  7 traces ['6b6e7a28e2cdba37e6e51ba67ad84ced', 'f87515cb76d7e92afd1f396e9288e912', '26c3b43eb6e315952161558aa8d426a4']\r\n87dc9d1a-02f6-49c0-92ae-cdfceb1b4dc3 open high 2026-10-12T06:38 \r\n  Enforce Structured JSON Outputs and Restrict Verbose Prose Generation for IFM/K2-Horizon-375B-A23B to Reduce Latency \r\n  The LLM `IFM/K2-Horizon-375B-A23B` is failing to adhere to the JSON-only formatting constraint in the system prompt, instead returning verbose plain text with unrequested fields like `Reasoning`. This formatting mismatch drastically increases token generation time, driving latency up to 40 seconds and causing responses to truncate before completion. While the exact reason for the model's sudden non-compliance is unknown, the high latency is directly caused by this runaway text generation. \r\n  9 traces ['16f9c0e35da999a4e9ac46ce2c7da9c7', '75a3662c47cb7e62793d3557eab5c967', 'f9cb7a14b89967b253253706c270fad7']","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"e3d8c052-a19d-438a-8b0a-69f2669cff11","timestamp":"2026-10-12T07:00:53.912Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"03af6a94-7ea3-4b92-b47b-79551c74ba26 open critical 2026-10-12T06:42 \r\n  Resolve Infinite Repair Loop in `create-storybook` Workflow by Capping Validation Retries and Relaxing `lesson_concept_in_scene` Guardrail \r\n  The `create-storybook` workflow enters an infinite or highly repetitive loop of generation and validation (`node.verify` and `node.settle`) when a guardrail violation (such as `lesson_concept_in_scene`) is detected. Because there is no strict cap on the number of repair attempts, the workflow runs until the client connection is closed or times out, resulting in a `Cannot send a request, as the client has been closed` error on downstream LLM calls. \r\n  7 traces ['6b6e7a28e2cdba37e6e51ba67ad84ced', 'f87515cb76d7e92afd1f396e9288e912', '26c3b43eb6e315952161558aa8d426a4']\r\na062a576-f517-4564-a1ac-7f406de62c15 open high 2026-10-12T06:42 \r\n  Investigate Latency and Quota Exhaustion in `illustrate` Tool \r\n  Root cause is not established. In trace {{trace:b2620d8e6a7ad46d31d872882b780677}}, the `illustrate` tool call takes 249,436ms to complete. During its execution, a call to `gemini-3.1-flash-image` fails with a `429 RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED` error, and a subsequent call to `gemini-2.5-flash-image` takes 8,054ms. The exact cause of the remaining ~241 seconds of latency within the `illustrate` tool is not established because the internal implementation details and retry/fallback mechanisms of the tool ar \r\n  7 traces ['6b6e7a28e2cdba37e6e51ba67ad84ced', 'f87515cb76d7e92afd1f396e9288e912', '26c3b43eb6e315952161558aa8d426a4']\r\n87dc9d1a-02f6-49c0-92ae-cdfceb1b4dc3 open high 2026-10-12T06:38 \r\n  Enforce Structured JSON Outputs and Restrict Verbose Prose Generation for IFM/K2-Horizon-375B-A23B to Reduce Latency \r\n  The LLM `IFM/K2-Horizon-375B-A23B` is failing to adhere to the JSON-only formatting constraint in the system prompt, instead returning verbose plain text with unrequested fields like `Reasoning`. This formatting mismatch drastically increases token generation time, driving latency up to 40 seconds and causing responses to truncate before completion. While the exact reason for the model's sudden non-compliance is unknown, the high latency is directly caused by this runaway text generation. \r\n  9 traces ['16f9c0e35da999a4e9ac46ce2c7da9c7', '75a3662c47cb7e62793d3557eab5c967', 'f9cb7a14b89967b253253706c270fad7']","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"37894345-156e-41fe-9405-e1ccccfaf63f","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/d/storybound","root":"/d/storybound","branch":"experiments/architecture-and-chaos","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":1,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":1},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"hatif03/storybound","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"hatif03/storybound","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"hatif03/storybound","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/d/storybound","platform":"windows"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"90d0ab40-db07-44bc-bc1d-736828cd0d85","permis