the drills were run before and after the fixes on the same five drawings, so the \"after\" rows are a re-test of the same cases, not a fresh sample. The stall drill's saving (about 50 s) is within the spread of the runs. C6's 23 minutes is a real weakness: with the image service failing, the child waits for pictures that may not come; the text pages are ready much earlier, and a hard time budget for pictures is not built.\n\n## Regression fixture\n`python scripts/run_experiments.py --only C3b,C4b,C7`; unit tests for each fix in `tests/test_pipeline.py` and `tests/test_judge.py`.\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"aedaa1c5-d4ff-4157-a874-d3a48e25c4aa","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"D:\\storybound","sessionId":"531bd6f2-4e0c-4a05-a2e1-9f902bd0eeb6","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"experiments/architecture-and-chaos","slug":"glimmering-splashing-ladybug"}
