{"parentUuid":"146e5843-f163-476e-9581-4e663208712a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CfwyTf2pSWFiKiZqkACHp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019gtFudrbHXRapW3Yc9qrDy","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python - <<'E'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nf=Path('docs/CREDITS.md'); s=f.read_text(encoding='utf-8')\nadd='''## What 12 Oct added (measured, ten held-out stories each; HR-014)\n| Use of the credits | Cost a story | What we learned |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Writer on Gemini 3.1 Pro (Vertex) | $0.113 | Half the repairs of the default writer (1.3 against 2.4) at 4.7 times the cost; no gain in clean stories, so not the default |\n| Writer on Claude Sonnet 4.6 (gateway) | $0.122 | More repairs (5.1), 5 times the cost: worse than Pro on this task |\n| A second judge (Sonnet beside K2) | $0.138 | No extra breaks shipped, 5.7 times the cost; kept as an option and as the failover when K2 is down ($0.129 a story in drill C4b) |\n| The audit pass (re-judging 80 pages three times) | about $1 | The measurement that shows repair, not detection, keeps promises |\n\nThe gateway estimate prices an unknown model at the dearest rate, so these figures are upper bounds. The credits remain evaluation money, not product spend.\n\n'''\nf.write_text(s.replace(\"## Rules we keep\",add+\"## Rules we keep\",1),encoding='utf-8')\nE\ncat \"$TEMP/poll_run.out\" | head -c 300","description":"Add the measured experiment costs to CREDITS"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":745,"cache_read_input_tokens":189061,"output_tokens":582,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":745,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations