{"parentUuid":"b512af25-4eda-4e3e-9b13-f110bd54e448","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfx2qZ761R1idkQs4GEN6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Progress on your four points (the app recording is still running):\n\n1. **Picture-words detection: it now fires.**\n   - I made a picture with big painted captions (\"HAPPY BUNNY / SHARE THE / CARROT!\") and swapped it in as the first painting of a real story. The vision judge flagged it, the agent repainted it, and the second picture passed.\n   - neatlogs' \"Picture has words painted in\" detection counted 1 occurrence. It had 0 before.\n   - The real painter's pictures on two other pages were flagged and repainted the same way. I haven't checked by eye whether those were real words or judge errors.\n   - Drill trace: `c2a67d3482bbdff5beb6df58a4daf92b`. The script is `scripts/drill_picture_words.py`.\n2. **Real \"before\" trace: recovered.** The export endpoint was down, so I read the full span lists through the project key instead. The before trace has 208 spans, 2 of 4 `illustrate` and 0 picture checks. The after trace has 225, 4 and 8. Both are saved in `evidence/traces/` and HR-016 is updated.\n3. **cfo.ai screenshots:** both are filed in `evidence/cfo/`, and they show the `Cost input` edit in Version history. STATUS is updated.\n4. **Recording:**\n   - **The app:** yes, I can record it, and a script is doing it now. My first take finished before the story did, so the receipt wasn't ready and no pictures showed. The new run waits for the receipt and pauses 22 seconds per page so the pictures arrive. The output will be `evidence/demo/app-walkthrough.webm`.\n   - **The three dashboards:** I'm not recording these. They sit behind your own logins, and I shouldn't sign in as you from a script. Record them with OBS or Game Bar (`Win + Alt + R`). [docs/DEMO-RECORDING-GUIDE.md](docs/DEMO-RECORDING-GUIDE.md) says what to click in each, with the trace IDs, plus a check for emails and keys before you export.\n   - **Using the app by hand:** the same guide has the click-by-click steps.\n\nBefore this, I also fixed the problems Entire's review found in the failure fixes (7 of its 10 points, all with tests), and pushed them to PR 4."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":365,"cache_read_input_tokens":313050,"output_tokens":772,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":365,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":772,"cache_read_input_tokens":313050,"cache_creation_input_tokens":365,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":365},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"70320486-2649-4ff3-9799-af84eddff1c7","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cfx2qYZ6Px9NRk2D7EhYp","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"1f951a0f-9df2-4aad-938f-9c4d584011e6","timestamp":"2026-10-12T08:32:16.665Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"D:\\storybound","sessionId":"531bd6f2-4e0c-4a05-a2e1-9f902bd0eeb6","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"experiments/architecture-and-chaos","slug":"glimmering-splashing-ladybug"}
