{"parentUuid":"3eed3c2b-cd42-48a0-9083-b224162310b7","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"419f33fc-96f6-4c2c-b1fc-7ed7e9517d67","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01U8pmRbHDLRybs7BCfia427","type":"tool_result","content":"`storyReducer` folds each event (ignoring any whose `id` it has already seen, so a reconnect that replays from the start is\nharmless). It tracks: the step Pip is on (looking, meeting the hero, writing/checking/fixing page N, painting, voice), accepted\npages, per-page picture and voice (`pending`, `ready` or `missing`), repairs, degradations, and each promise of the oath as\n`waiting / checking / fixing / kept / kept_after_fix / not_kept / unchecked`. The reader opens page 1 the moment it is accepted;\npictures and voices that have not arrived show a gentle \"Pip is still painting\", and ones that never arrive (a `degraded` event, or\nthe run ending) show a text-only page. The child's sticker sheet fills only when every checked promise in a family is kept; the\nreceipt shows everything, including promises not kept or not checked this time.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"ed8e3530-db2b-4762-95f6-6417b1290e0a","timestamp":"2026-10-12T09:02:33.507Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"`storyReducer` folds each event (ignoring any whose `id` it has already seen, so a reconnect that replays from the start is\nharmless). It tracks: the step Pip is on (looking, meeting the hero, writing/checking/fixing page N, painting, voice), accepted\npages, per-page picture and voice (`pending`, `ready` or `missing`), repairs, degradations, and each promise of the oath as\n`waiting / checking / fixing / kept / kept_after_fix / not_kept / unchecked`. The reader opens page 1 the moment it is accepted;\npictures and voices that have not arrived show a gentle \"Pip is still painting\", and ones that never arrive (a `degraded` event, or\nthe run ending) show a text-only page. The child's sticker sheet fills only when every checked promise in a family is kept; the\nreceipt shows everything, including promises not kept or not checked this time.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"dae36b49-31b0-4189-a222-10e99f86504c","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/d/storybound","root":null,"branch":null,"default_branch":null,"status":null,"visibility":null,"error":"pending"},"live_cwd":"/d/storybound","platform":"windows"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"3eed3c2b-cd42-48a0-9083-b224162310b7","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"D:\\storybound","sessionId":"531bd6f2-4e0c-4a05-a2e1-9f902bd0eeb6","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"experiments/architecture-and-chaos","slug":"glimmering-splashing-ladybug"}
