{"parentUuid":"0fa0c533-0b64-422e-bc91-a261e07f53be","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CfxBcjEDv1wuGZRuYo6YE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Kdtb5f7rf4asFaY7ofqqNF","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cp evidence/demo/work/cues.json evidence/demo/recording-cues.json && cp evidence/demo/work/receipt.txt evidence/demo/recording-receipt.txt && rm -rf evidence/demo/work/frames evidence/demo/work/screen.mp4 evidence/demo/work/mix.wav && du -sh evidence/demo/* | head; cat > \"$TEMP/docs3.py\" <<'PYEOF'\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\ndef sub(p, pairs):\n    f = Path(p); s = f.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    for a, b in pairs:\n        assert a in s, (p, a[:70])\n        s = s.replace(a, b, 1)\n    f.write_text(s, encoding=\"utf-8\", newline=\"\")\n\nsub(\"hackathon.md\", [(\"- Tests that ran: 106 backend\", \"- The app walkthrough was recorded with sound and a voice-over after a design change: a page is shown only when its words, picture and voice all exist (`story.verified`, narration started as each page is accepted). The headless browser has no sound card, so `web/scripts/record-demo.mjs` logs every sound the app plays with its time and captures timestamped frames, and `scripts/compose_demo.py` puts the sound back (voice-over by `scripts/make_demo_voiceover.py`). Three earlier takes were thrown away: the first walked through pages before they were made, the second cut narration off by clicking Next too early, the third compressed idle time so the sound would not line up. Final: `evidence/demo/app-walkthrough.mp4` (12 min) and `-cut.mp4` (9 min, waits sped up); the story was real (cost about $0.46, 27 promises checked, 2 pages rewritten, all kept; `recording-receipt.txt`).\\n- Tests that ran: 106 backend\")])\nsub(\"docs/STATUS.md\", [(\"| **Demo video (last)** | Requested last | `scripts/make_video.py` with `requires_coverage` (see HANDOFF.md); at most 3:00 |\",\n \"| **Demo video (last)** | The app capture is made, with sound and a voice-over (`evidence/demo/app-walkthrough.mp4` and the cut, 12 Oct); the neatlogs, Entire and cfo.ai dashboards are yours to record | [DEMO-SCRIPT.md](DEMO-SCRIPT.md), [DEMO-RECORDING-GUIDE.md](DEMO-RECORDING-GUIDE.md); at most 3:00 |\")])\nPYEOF\npython \"$TEMP/docs3.py\" && echo ok","description":"Save recording evidence, clean the large frames, update docs"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":892,"cache_read_input_tokens":441176,"output_tokens":1196,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":217},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":892,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1196,"cache_read_input_tokens":441176,"cache_creation_input_tokens":892,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":892},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01Kdtb5f7rf4asFaY7ofqqNF":{"command":"cd /d/storybound && cp evidence/demo/work/cues.json evidence/demo/recording-cues.json && cp evidence/demo/work/receipt.txt evidence/demo/recording-receipt.txt && rm -rf evidence/demo/work/frames evidence/demo/work/screen.mp4 evidence/demo/work/mix.wav && du -sh evidence/demo/* | head; cat > \"$TEMP/docs3.py\" <<'PYEOF'\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\ndef sub(p, pairs):\n    f = Path(p); s = f.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    for a, b in pairs:\n        assert a in s, (p, a[:70])\n        s = s.replace(a, b, 1)\n    f.write_text(s, encoding=\"utf-8\", newline=\"\")\n\nsub(\"hackathon.md\", [(\"- Tests that ran: 106 backend\", \"- The app walkthrough was recorded with sound and a voice-over after a design change: a page is shown only when its words, picture and voice all exist (`story.verified`, narration started as each page is accepted). The headless browser has no sound card, so `web/scripts/record-demo.mjs` logs every sound the app plays with its time and captures timestamped frames, and `scripts/compose_demo.py` puts the sound back (voice-over by `scripts/make_demo_voiceover.py`). Three earlier takes were thrown away: the first walked through pages before they were made, the second cut narration off by clicking Next too early, the third compressed idle time so the sound would not line up. Final: `evidence/demo/app-walkthrough.mp4` (12 min) and `-cut.mp4` (9 min, waits sped up); the story was real (cost about $0.46, 27 promises checked, 2 pages rewritten, all kept; `recording-receipt.txt`).\\n- Tests that ran: 106 backend\")])\nsub(\"docs/STATUS.md\", [(\"| **Demo video (last)** | Requested last | `scripts/make_video.py` with `requires_coverage` (see HANDOFF.md); at most 3:00 |\",\n \"| **Demo video (last)** | The app capture is made, with sound and a voice-over (`evidence/demo/app-walkthrough.mp4` and the cut, 12 Oct); the neatlogs, Entire and cfo.ai dashboards are yours to record | [DEMO-SCRIPT.md](DEMO-SCRIPT.md), [DEMO-RECORDING-GUIDE.md](DEMO-RECORDING-GUIDE.md); at most 3:00 |\")])\nPYEOF\npython \"$TEMP/docs3.py\" && echo ok","description":"Save recording evidence, clean the large frames, update docs"}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_01Kdtb5f7rf4asFaY7ofqqNF":{"cwd":"/d/storybound"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"18c719d7-52a1-49c5-b4e3-92fba9e21a42","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfxBcianAgXVXFhxRVQPJ","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"dd573996-a6e3-46aa-a85f-a2294b66671d","timestamp":"2026-10-12T10:27:27.009Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"D:\\storybound","sessionId":"531bd6f2-4e0c-4a05-a2e1-9f902bd0eeb6","version":"2.1.