{"parentUuid":"6e79bac6-5e64-427a-b5f6-6c2642d42f70","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CfxFhKS6mUcDZusgGqwjw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Pages now read themselves aloud about 2 seconds after they open, and I'm re-recording the walkthrough to show it. The recording takes about 15 minutes, and I'll mix the sound and voice-over when it finishes.\n\n**The change:**\n- **Default and timing:** sound is now on by default, and each page waits about 2 seconds (1.8 s) after opening so the child sees the picture, then reads itself aloud. Nothing plays before the first tap on Welcome.\n- **Replay button:** the Listen button stays. While the page is reading it says \"Stop\", and once it has been read it says \"Listen again\", for as many replays as anyone wants.\n- **Checked:** I tested this in a browser. The narration started about 2.1 s after the page appeared, and the button read \"Listen again\" afterwards. The touch and quiz browser checks still pass.\n- **Answering early:** a child who answers before the reading starts won't have the reading start afterwards.\n\nI also updated the voice-over line for the first page to explain this.\n\n**Neatlogs message:** I put a checklist and drafts in [docs/SUBMISSION.md](docs/SUBMISSION.md). It has both required steps (quote-tweet tagging @neatlogs, @EntireHQ and @arithecfo, plus the form), a project description, and a quote-tweet draft. Both links arrive at 7 PM IST.\n\n**Open before you submit:**\n- **Merge PR 4 first.** It is still a draft, so `main` doesn't yet have the experiments, fixes or recording tools. Tell me if you want me to merge it.\n- You still need to record the three dashboards and cut the 3:00 video.\n- Rotate the two keys after the last run that needs them."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":544,"cache_read_input_tokens":465028,"output_tokens":563,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":544,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":563,"cache_read_input_tokens":465028,"cache_creation_input_tokens":544,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":544},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"8b252c45-8af6-4ef8-8f74-8dc27ae91726","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfxFhJqt8XJpmw5vWjJeu","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"c10a5e09-1e9b-411f-ab63-da29d383100b","timestamp":"2026-10-12T11:20:53.262Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"D:\\storybound\\web","sessionId":"531bd6f2-4e0c-4a05-a2e1-9f902bd0eeb6","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"experiments/architecture-and-chaos","slug":"glimmering-splashing-ladybug"}
