{"parentUuid":"235a0ba5-7e5e-46b3-b7d7-f9050b17dabb","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CfxJeJnvTYbErcvB47RUE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HtXWPGZv41EbKifbntUQhF","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat > \"$TEMP/docs4.py\" <<'PYEOF'\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\ndef sub(p, pairs):\n    f = Path(p); s = f.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    for a, b in pairs:\n        assert a in s, (p, a[:70])\n        s = s.replace(a, b, 1)\n    f.write_text(s, encoding=\"utf-8\", newline=\"\")\n\nsub(\"hackathon.md\", [(\"Three earlier takes were thrown away: the first walked through pages before they were made, the second cut narration off by clicking Next too early, the third compressed idle time so the sound would not line up. Final: `evidence/app-capture/app-walkthrough.mp4` (12 min) and `-cut.mp4` (9 min, waits sped up); the story was real (cost about $0.46, 27 promises checked, 2 pages rewritten, all kept; `recording-receipt.txt`).\",\n  \"Earlier takes were thrown away: one walked through pages before they were made, one cut narration off by clicking Next too early (twice: also on pages held back for their pictures), one compressed idle time so the sound would not line up, one was cropped. After the owner's request, pages also read themselves aloud 1.8 s after opening (sound on by default) with a Listen again button. Final: `evidence/app-capture/app-walkthrough.mp4` (about 15 min) and `-cut.mp4` (about 10 min, waits sped up); the story was real and its receipt reads \\\"26 promises checked. 0 pages rewritten. 4 could not be fully kept: image_matches_card, image_no_text, quiz_no_tell, quiz_reading_level. Shipped with notes\\\" (`recording-receipt.txt`): the receipt in the video shows an honest imperfect run, not a perfect one.\")])\nsub(\"docs/DEMO-RECORDING-GUIDE.md\", [(\"(about 14 minutes, 1440 x 810)\", \"(about 15 minutes, 1440 x 810)\"), (\"sped up 12 times and silent; about 9 minutes.\", \"sped up 12 times and silent; about 10 minutes.\"),\n (\"It is a real story, made while the recording runs (real models, about $0.45), not a mock.\", \"It is a real story, made while the recording runs (real models, about $0.45), not a mock. Its receipt (`recording-receipt.txt`) says 26 promises checked, 0 pages rewritten and 4 not fully kept (two picture checks and two quiz checks), shipped with notes: say so in the voice-over for the receipt if you show it, or re-run the recording for a cleaner receipt; do not call it \\\"all kept\\\".\"),\n (\"| Reading | Page 1 with its picture and voice, a choice, a wrong answer or a right answer | A wrong answer is never a scolding |\", \"| Reading | Page 1 with its picture; after about two seconds its voice starts reading by itself; the Listen button becomes \\\"Listen again\\\"; a choice | Pages read themselves aloud; a wrong answer is never a scolding |\")])\nPYEOF\npython \"$TEMP/docs4.py\" && grep -n \"all kept\\|All kept\" docs/DEMO-SCRIPT.md docs/DEMO-RECORDING-GUIDE.md | head","description":"Make the docs match the final recording's real receipt"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":669,"cache_read_input_tokens":473347,"output_tokens":1455,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":270},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":669,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1455,"cache_read_input_tokens":473347,"cache_creation_input_tokens":669,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":669},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01HtXWPGZv41EbKifbntUQhF":{"command":"cd /d/storybound && cat > \"$TEMP/docs4.py\" <<'PYEOF'\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\ndef sub(p, pairs):\n    f = Path(p); s = f.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    for a, b in pairs:\n        assert a in s, (p, a[:70])\n        s = s.replace(a, b, 1)\n    f.write_text(s, encoding=\"utf-8\", newline=\"\")\n\nsub(\"hackathon.md\", [(\"Three earlier takes were thrown away: the first walked through pages before they were made, the second cut narration off by clicking Next too early, the third compressed idle time so the sound would not line up. Final: `evidence/app-capture/app-walkthrough.mp4` (12 min) and `-cut.mp4` (9 min, waits sped up); the story was real (cost about $0.46, 27 promises checked, 2 pages rewritten, all kept; `recording-receipt.txt`).\",\n  \"Earlier takes were thrown away: one walked through pages before they were made, one cut narration off by clicking Next too early (twice: also on pages held back for their pictures), one compressed idle time so the sound would not line up, one was cropped. After the owner's request, pages also read themselves aloud 1.8 s after opening (sound on by default) with a Listen again button. Final: `evidence/app-capture/app-walkthrough.mp4` (about 15 min) and `-cut.mp4` (about 10 min, waits sped up); the story was real and its receipt reads \\\"26 promises checked. 0 pages rewritten. 4 could not be fully kept: image_matches_card, image_no_text, quiz_no_tell, quiz_reading_level. Shipped with notes\\\" (`recording-receipt.txt`): the receipt in the video shows an honest imperfect run, not a perfect one.\")])\nsub(\"docs/DEMO-RECORDING-GUIDE.md\", [(\"(about 14 minutes, 1440 x 810)\", \"(about 15 minutes, 1440 x 810)\"), (\"sped up 12 times and silent; about 9 minutes.\", \"sped up 12 times and silent; about 10 minutes.\"),\n (\"It is a real story, made while the recording runs (real models, about $0.45), not a mock.\", \"It is a real story, made while the recording runs (real models, about $0.45), not a mock. Its receipt (`recording-receipt.txt`) says 26 promises checked, 0 pages rewritten and 4 not fully kept (two picture checks and two quiz checks), shipped with notes: say so in the voice-over for the receipt if you show it, or re-run the recording for a cleaner receipt; do not call it \\\"all kept\\\".\"),\n (\"| Reading | Page 1 with its picture and voice, a choice, a wrong answer or a right answer | A wrong answer is never a scolding |\", \"| Reading | Page 1 with its picture; after about two seconds its voice starts reading by itself; the Listen button becomes \\\"Listen again\\\"; a choice | Pages read themselves aloud; a wrong answer is never a scolding |\")])\nPYEOF\npython \"$TEMP/docs4.py\" && grep -n \"all kept\\|All kept\" docs/DEMO-SCRIPT.md docs/DEMO-RECORDING-GUIDE.md | head","description":"Make the docs match the final recording's real receipt"}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_01HtXWPGZv41EbKifbntUQhF":{"cwd":"/d/storybound"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"73428cc8-7330-46b9-ae7a-9a3e11cceb26","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfxJeJGAYQXpBhtuuLVfS","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"e656e12f-2f14-4e7d-b208-ee3296b9341c","timestamp":"2026-10-12T11:59:38.368Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"D:\\storybound","sessionId":"531bd6f2-4e0c-4a05-a2e1-9f902bd0eeb6","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"experiments/architecture-and-chaos","slug":"glimmering-splashing-ladybug"}
{"parentUuid":"e656e12f-2f14-4e7d-b208-ee3296b9341c","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a712cd95-91a3-4dab-bd20-98152f03ad04","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HtXWPGZv41EbKifbntUQhF","type":"tool_result","content":"docs/DEMO-SCRIPT.md:10:| 0:20 to 0:50 | The receipt screen: \"28 promises checked, all kept\"; then a page failing a check and being rewritten | \"Storybound is an agent that writes an oath for each drawing and lesson, checks every page against it before the child sees it, rewrites any page that breaks it, and hands the parent a receipt. On the same writer, 27 of 28 stories shipped a broken promise without the checks. With them, none of 28.\" | [report](../evidence/reports/20261010-1505-IST-sweep-2-p2.md), [HR-008](../evidence/hardening/HR-008.md) |\ndocs/DEMO-RECORDING-GUIDE.md:21:It is a real story, made while the recording runs (real models, about $0.45), not a mock. Its receipt (`recording-receipt.txt`) says 26 promises checked, 0 pages rewritten and 4 not fully kept (two picture checks and two quiz checks), shipped with notes: say so in the voice-over for the receipt if you show it, or re-run the recording for a cleaner receipt; do not call it \"all kept\". Every screen is shown only when everything for it exists (words, picture, voice), so the recording holds on Pip's making screen while pages are made; the cut speeds those holds up.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"d4c5e113-287e-4c16-b6bc-4d19f764036c","timestamp":"2026-10-12T11:59:40.030Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"docs/DEMO-SCRIPT.md:10:| 0:20 to 0:50 | The receipt screen: \"28 promises checked, all kept\"; then a page failing a check and being rewritten | \"Storybound is an agent that writes an oath for each drawing and lesson, checks every page against it before the child sees it, rewrites any page that breaks it, and hands the parent a receipt. On the same writer, 27 of 28 stories shipped a broken promise without the checks. With them, none of 28.\" | [report](../evidence/reports/20261010-1505-IST-sweep-2-p2.md), [HR-008](../evidence/hardening/HR-008.md) |\ndocs/DEMO-RECORDING-GUIDE.md:21:It is a real story, made while the recording runs (real models, about $0.45), not a mock. Its receipt (`recording-receipt.txt`) says 26 promises checked, 0 pages rewritten and 4 not fully kept (two picture checks and two quiz checks), shipped with notes: say so in the voice-over for the receipt if you show it, or re-run the recording for a cleaner receipt; do not call it \"all kept\". Every screen is shown only when everything for it exists (words, picture, voice), so the recording holds on Pip's making screen while pages are made; the cut speeds those holds up.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"73428cc8-7330-46b9-ae7a-9a3e11cceb26","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/d/storybound","root":"/d/storybound","branch":"experiments/architecture-and-chaos","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":20,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":1},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"hatif03/storybound","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"hatif03/storybound","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"hatif03/storybound","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/d/storybound","platform":"windows"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"e656e12f-2f14-4e7d-b208-ee3296b9341c","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"D:\\storybound","sessionId":"531bd6f2-4e0c-4a05-a2e1-9f902bd0eeb6","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"experiments/architecture-and-chaos","slug":"glimmering-splashing-ladybug"}
